{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dStory\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuto Fujimoto is a shut-in with a knack for computers and an unhealthy obsession with idols. When Facibook offers him a job censoring adult content, he takes it reluctantly, spending his days scrubbing images that violate community guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the work is mind-numbing. However, as the flagged posts pile up, Yuto starts noticing something strange. Behind the filters and file names lie hidden connections to three women in his life: Misa, the married apartment manager. Yui, his favorite idol. And Rika, the pious nun at the local church. All of them are harboring secrets he never expected to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a mundane job takes a wild turn when Yuto mistakenly lets adult content slip past moderation. The strange reactions from his neighbors and the media suggest something's changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/e21e7cbe1f214a6fd6381c57671a336e.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Overview\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is split into four time slots, giving you time to earn money, rise through the ranks, and explore the city while deepening your connections with NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/1196ec8bc67a432e236e8c9c910dc77d.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll progress through five ranks, from Intern to Manager, unlocking better pay and greater freedom with each promotion. With that freedom comes opportunity: once you\u2019ve proven yourself, you can start making \u201cmistakes\u201d on purpose, letting explicit content slip through to quietly raise the world\u2019s CHAOS level without getting fired for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world slips deeper into chaos, the NPCs begin to behave in unexpected and perverse ways. Dialogue shifts, outfits change, and new lewd events are unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/f12413e5e08f09e42a28e213f8b33b1b.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Misa Hashimoto\u2019s route to buy a bus card at the convenience store. This opens up the Church, Convention, and Police Station\u2014each packed with new content and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/b860871737624ebe1cbf38eb646af2b7.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7887a0ca814e5921af6499dc4ce3d299.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8a67856c4a760d33d59ea0ecdbfa54d0.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest update includes all DLC, featuring a fresh new target of desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Play\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day consists of four periods\u2014Morning, Afternoon, Evening and Night. Plan your schedule wisely to boost relationships, earn cash, and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find opportunities to get closer to the heroine. Rank up as a censor and keep driving the world further into chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique missions and mini-games await at both the Church and the Convention. Engage in confessionals, sing hymns, or dive into the more depraved side of religious devotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dCharacters\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/66dba37b2326df77eeb8ac5763517ab4.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Voice Cast&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Maria Ayana: Misa, Yui</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Megumu Morino: Rika, Yuriko(DLC content)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dFeatures\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfOver a dozen mini-games and side missions bring extra layers to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfEnjoy 60+ pixel-art erotic animations and more than 200 CG variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfThree major zones and over 30 unique NPCs await. Most female NPCs are fair game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExpect surprise cameos from Chiho, Lilith from NTRaholic and other beloved characters from games publishing by Mango Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/65464fb08de89c11bff12507283d2a17.avif?t=1758780886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCharacters and visuals borrowed from other titles are all officially licensed and approved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bv4.0.13 Update . Full Mouse Support. The game can now be played entirely with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Right-click to move your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Left-click to confirm buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c52f385f01e89218e6c1424f5ba850cc.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c52f385f01e89218e6c1424f5ba850cc.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c52f385f01e89218e6c1424f5ba850cc.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Night Pact \u00b7 Misa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/0323d4e1ebcab25a46f55e7c759ba8e8110eacb6.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Route \u00b7 Misa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/263d5cd02727cdc79d1d2e900798bbd57ba5cf6a.jpg"},{"name":"Starlit First Embrace \u00b7 Yui","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/f1395de13990b8f0e1aab41d75cf061775809665.jpg"},{"name":"Chasing the Light \u00b7 Yui","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/9f6b74a1ed18c32b9ce281930098c9160c8c16a5.jpg"},{"name":"Kiss of Prayer \u00b7 Rika","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/dca9c56d72597699cb39af969de9603a57eab1e3.jpg"},{"name":"Bells\u2019 Finale \u00b7 Rika","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/bd44ed6e445f5137aacb93b4ecbc2911c309db3b.jpg"},{"name":"Alleyway Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/72d588bf97adaef3948fcf62cc73a6337059eee1.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Counter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/5d888391206fc30d16442b614cb8a1855226a01b.jpg"},{"name":"Customer Perk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/663937ecb73198ace81b4cff7398a266151d9c94.jpg"},{"name":"Whispers Next Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2755480/306fb01f7d12167b6ef42aa4e4574fa479ac3549.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2755480?t=1758780886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2755480?t=1758780886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/61ba93b8e6c43b81b94e9575a3d1250f9cbfd8cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758780886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/61ba93b8e6c43b81b94e9575a3d1250f9cbfd8cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758780886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All character depicted are over the age of 20.\r\nContent Warning! This game contains:  netorare, exhibitionism, BDSM, sex acts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dStory\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuto Fujimoto is a shut-in with a knack for computers and an unhealthy obsession with idols. When Facibook offers him a job censoring adult content, he takes it reluctantly, spending his days scrubbing images that violate community guidelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the work is mind-numbing. However, as the flagged posts pile up, Yuto starts noticing something strange. Behind the filters and file names lie hidden connections to three women in his life: Misa, the married apartment manager. Yui, his favorite idol. And Rika, the pious nun at the local church. All of them are harboring secrets he never expected to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a mundane job takes a wild turn when Yuto mistakenly lets adult content slip past moderation. The strange reactions from his neighbors and the media suggest something's changed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/e21e7cbe1f214a6fd6381c57671a336e.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Overview\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is split into four time slots, giving you time to earn money, rise through the ranks, and explore the city while deepening your connections with NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/1196ec8bc67a432e236e8c9c910dc77d.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/566cef820dc274aac0ab5ceec3183b92.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/84bf352fd5e71fdf32c5543d35ae508e.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll progress through five ranks, from Intern to Manager, unlocking better pay and greater freedom with each promotion. With that freedom comes opportunity: once you\u2019ve proven yourself, you can start making \u201cmistakes\u201d on purpose, letting explicit content slip through to quietly raise the world\u2019s CHAOS level without getting fired for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world slips deeper into chaos, the NPCs begin to behave in unexpected and perverse ways. Dialogue shifts, outfits change, and new lewd events are unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/f12413e5e08f09e42a28e213f8b33b1b.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/826dd53b4e5aa050b9c18eab265694b0.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Misa Hashimoto\u2019s route to buy a bus card at the convenience store. This opens up the Church, Convention, and Police Station\u2014each packed with new content and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/b860871737624ebe1cbf38eb646af2b7.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7887a0ca814e5921af6499dc4ce3d299.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8a67856c4a760d33d59ea0ecdbfa54d0.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newest update includes all DLC, featuring a fresh new target of desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dGame Play\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day consists of four periods\u2014Morning, Afternoon, Evening and Night. Plan your schedule wisely to boost relationships, earn cash, and uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find opportunities to get closer to the heroine. Rank up as a censor and keep driving the world further into chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/22a36b1d5bf3e9d1383191fc4edc3b4c.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique missions and mini-games await at both the Church and the Convention. Engage in confessionals, sing hymns, or dive into the more depraved side of religious devotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/63d8a61be06e3bdfd36ef93efb8f8ad5.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/8ce31409f3c4332bf7e777f9015b4de8.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c77a6972adcf9dfb826f09137997e370.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.poster.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.webm?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/7ae657de82ed6bfb1358d5108c0a8fc1.mp4?t=1758780886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dCharacters\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/66dba37b2326df77eeb8ac5763517ab4.avif?t=1758780886\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Voice Cast&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Maria Ayana: Misa, Yui</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Megumu Morino: Rika, Yuriko(DLC content)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd3dFeatures\ud83d\udd3d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfOver a dozen mini-games and side missions bring extra layers to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfEnjoy 60+ pixel-art erotic animations and more than 200 CG variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfThree major zones and over 30 unique NPCs await. Most female NPCs are fair game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExpect surprise cameos from Chiho, Lilith from NTRaholic and other beloved characters from games publishing by Mango Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/65464fb08de89c11bff12507283d2a17.avif?t=1758780886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCharacters and visuals borrowed from other titles are all officially licensed and approved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bv4.0.13 Update . Full Mouse Support. The game can now be played entirely with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Right-click to move your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Left-click to confirm buttons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/c52